This release preserves the original clean-room Python JEV Lab harness and
adapts its calibration studio into a standalone React component. New public
rubric templates and demonstration fixtures are synthetic. No third-party
source code is vendored. React and development tools retain their own licenses.

The OmniSI Cloud JEV Oracle, its Rust engine, production compliance rubrics,
and live consensus router are proprietary and are not part of this release.
